  "description": "Lee Seju, the daughter of the Chosin Group's president director has the ability to see spirits. Peculiarly, they always try to after her life.  \nOne day, a spirit named Wollang suddenly came from the moon to look for his mace, which was stolen from him a thousand years ago. Wollang promised Lee Seju that he would help her to close her spiritual ability--if she help him to find his mace.\n\n**Original Webtoon: **  \n[Kakaopage](https://page.kakao.com/home/%EA%B7%80%ED%95%98%EC%8B%A0-%EB%8B%98/46722325), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/845012755)\n\n**Official Translation: **  \n[Indonesian](https://id.kakaowebtoon.com/content/Pelindung-dari-Bulan/491)",
